---
import { getCollection } from 'astro:content';
import Layout from './Layout.astro';
import dog from './assets/dog.svg?url';
import proposal from './assets/roundtails-proposal.webp?url';
import pax from './assets/gav-and-pax.webp?url';
const posts = await getCollection('blog');
const related = ['building-for-yourself-vs-building-for-users', 'getting-into-agentic-coding'].map(id => posts.find(p => p.id === id)).filter(p => p !== undefined);
---
<Layout title="Roundtails | Gav Elliott">
 <main id="main" tabindex="-1" class="project-edition">
  <nav class="project-breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/design/work/">Work & apps</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">Roundtails</span></nav>
  <header class="project-cover">
   <div class="project-kicker"><p class="eyebrow">An app of my own</p><span>In development</span></div>
   <h1>Roundtails<span>.</span></h1>
   <div class="project-cover-bottom"><div><p class="project-deck">Less admin.<br/>More time for the dogs.</p><p class="project-summary">I’m building software for independent dog walkers, from the first enquiry to the regular walking week.</p><a class="project-button" href="https://roundtails.com">Visit Roundtails <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></div><div class="project-puppy" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><img src={dog} alt="" width="600" height="420"/></div></div>
  </header>
  <dl class="project-facts"><div><dt>For</dt><dd>Independent dog walkers</dd></div><div><dt>My part</dt><dd>Design & build</dd></div><div><dt>Made through</dt><dd><a href="https://craftedbyfort.com">Crafted by Fort</a></dd></div></dl>
  <section class="project-origin" aria-labelledby="origin-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Where it started</p><h2 id="origin-title">It started<br/>with Pax.</h2><p>Pax has had the same dog walker since he was a pup. Over that time, I’ve seen the admin she’s been trying to keep on top of alongside the rest of her business and life in general.</p><p>That’s where Roundtails began. Seeing someone caring for the dogs while also trying to find time for all the work around them made me want to help.</p></div><figure><img src={pax} alt="Illustration of me crouching beside Pax as a puppy in the garden" width="800" height="450" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/><figcaption>Me and Pax, back when he was a little smaller.</figcaption></figure></section>
  <aside class="project-pullquote"><p>I don’t think running a dog walking business should mean spending half your life on admin.</p></aside>
  <section class="project-product" aria-labelledby="product-title"><header><div><p class="eyebrow">What I’m building</p><h2 id="product-title">From an enquiry<br/>to a walking week.</h2></div><p>I’m bringing enquiries, client details and regular walks together. The aim is to cut down on the retyping, chasing and piecing things together.</p></header>
   <ol class="project-journey"><li><span aria-hidden="true">01</span><h3>Get to know the dog</h3><p>Keep the enquiry, conversations and meeting details together.</p></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">02</span><h3>Work out the routine</h3><p>Check the walking week and put together a proposal with days, collection times and prices.</p></li><li><span aria-hidden="true">03</span><h3>Get ready to walk</h3><p>Carry the agreed routine into registration, with the dog’s care details and permissions.</p></li></ol>
   <figure class="project-screen"><a href={proposal} aria-label="View the Roundtails proposal screenshot at full size"><img src={proposal} alt="Roundtails proposal review showing two walks a week, collection times and prices alongside the checks before sending it to the owner" width="1280" height="1165" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/></a><figcaption><span>A proposal before it goes to the owner. Development screenshot with example data.</span><a href={proposal}>View full size <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></figcaption></figure>
  </section>
  <section class="project-principle" aria-labelledby="principle-title"><p class="eyebrow">The bit that matters</p><div><h2 id="principle-title">The walker<br/>makes the call.</h2><p>The software should carry information forward and handle the repetitive bits. The decisions that depend on knowing a dog, building trust or recognising a good fit stay with the walker.</p></div></section>
  <section class="project-current" aria-labelledby="current-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">Where it is now</p><h2 id="current-title">Still building.</h2><p>The app is in development. The Roundtails site has more about the product, guides for dog walkers and a list for launch updates.</p></div><a class="project-button" href="https://roundtails.com">Have a look at Roundtails <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a></section>
  <section class="project-reading" aria-labelledby="reading-title"><header><h2 id="reading-title">Writing about building</h2><a href="/design/writing/">All writing →</a></header><div>{related.map(post=><article><h3><a href={`/design/post/${post.id}/`}>{post.data.title}</a></h3><p>{post.data.description}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <a class="project-back" href="/design/work/">← Back to work & apps</a>
 </main>
</Layout>
<style is:inline>
.project-edition{padding-bottom:30px}.project-breadcrumb{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:12px;padding:22px 0;font:700 13px/1.5 var(--ui)}.project-cover{background:var(--green);color:var(--paper);padding:30px 36px 0;overflow:hidden}.project-kicker{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:16px}.project-kicker span{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);border:1px solid currentColor;padding:6px 10px}.project-cover h1{font:400 clamp(40px,8.2vw,118px)/1.2 var(--display);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.035em;margin-top:20px}.project-cover h1>span{color:var(--yellow)}.project-cover-bottom{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:20px}.project-cover-bottom>div:first-child{padding:20px 0 35px}.project-deck{font:400 clamp(25px,3vw,40px)/1.35 var(--serif)}.project-summary{font-size:18px;max-width:450px;margin:20px 0;line-height:1.65}.project-button{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:20px;padding:14px 18px;background:var(--yellow);color:var(--ink);font:700 14px/1.5 var(--ui);text-decoration:none;min-height:48px}.project-button:hover{text-decoration:underline}.project-puppy{position:relative;align-self:stretch;min-height:280px}.project-puppy span{position:absolute;border-radius:50%;background:var(--yellow);width:190px;height:190px;top:0;right:10%}.project-puppy img{position:absolute;width:110%;max-width:none;height:100%;object-fit:contain;bottom:-24px;right:-20px;transform:rotate(-3deg)}.project-facts{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));margin:0;border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}.project-facts>div{padding:20px 0}.project-facts>div+div{border-left:1px solid var(--rule);padding-left:24px}.project-facts dt{font:700 12px/1.5 var(--ui);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:5px}.project-facts dd{margin:0;font-size:18px;line-height:1.5}.project-origin{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:55px;padding:50px 0;align-items:center}.project-edition h2{font:400 clamp(30px,3.7vw,50px)/1.2 var(--display);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:-.02em}.project-origin p:not(.eyebrow),.project-principle p:not(.eyebrow),.project-current p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:20px;line-height:1.65;margin-top:20px}.project-origin figure{margin:0}.project-origin img{display:block;width:100%;border:2px solid var(--ink)}.project-edition figcaption{font:700 12px/1.6 var(--ui);padding-top:12px}.project-pullquote{background:var(--yellow);padding:32px 40px;border-top:3px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:3px solid var(--ink)}.project-pullquote p{font:400 clamp(25px,3.2vw,42px)/1.4 var(--serif);max-width:1000px;text-wrap:pretty}.project-product{padding:45px 0}.project-product>header{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.2fr 1fr;gap:50px;align-items:end}.project-product>header>p{font-size:20px;line-height:1.65}.project-journey{list-style:none;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:30px;padding:0;margin:32px 0}.project-journey li{border-top:1px solid var(--ink);padding:18px 0}.project-journey li>span{font:400 32px var(--display);color:var(--green)}.project-journey h3{font:700 19px/1.4 var(--ui);margin:12px 0}.project-journey p{line-height:1.65}.project-screen{margin:0;background:#e3dcc8;padding:24px}.project-screen img{display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:1px solid var(--rule)}.project-screen figcaption{display:flex;gap:20px;justify-content:space-between}.project-screen figcaption>a{flex-shrink:0}.project-principle{padding:35px 0;border-top:2px solid var(--ink);border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink)}.project-principle>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:50px}.project-principle p:not(.eyebrow){margin:0}.project-current{margin-top:30px;background:var(--green);color:var(--paper);padding:32px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:40px;justify-content:space-between}.project-current>div{max-width:650px}.project-current .project-button{flex-shrink:0}.project-reading{padding:40px 0 30px}.project-reading>header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:20px}.project-reading h2{font-size:30px}.project-reading header>a,.project-back{font:700 14px/1.5 var(--ui)}.project-reading>div{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:36px;margin-top:22px}.project-reading article{border-top:1px solid var(--rule);padding-top:20px}.project-reading h3{font:400 25px/1.4 var(--serif);margin-bottom:14px}.project-reading p{line-height:1.65}.project-back{display:inline-block;padding:12px 0}
@media(max-width:1000px){.project-origin{gap:30px}.project-current{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:24px}.project-cover{padding:24px 26px 0}.project-facts dd{font-size:16px}}
@media(max-width:760px){.project-cover{padding:22px 22px 0}.project-cover h1{font-size:clamp(27px,7.6vw,58px)}.project-kicker{align-items:start;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px}.project-kicker .eyebrow{margin:0}.project-cover-bottom{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0}.project-cover-bottom>div:first-child{padding-bottom:0}.project-puppy{min-height:240px;margin-top:12px}.project-puppy img{width:110%;right:-10px;bottom:-20px}.project-puppy span{width:150px;height:150px;right:5%;top:15px}.project-facts{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);padding:14px 0}.project-facts>div,.project-facts>div+div{border:0;padding:8px 0;display:grid;grid-template-columns:95px minmax(0,1fr);gap:10px}.project-origin,.project-product>header,.project-principle>div{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px}.project-origin{padding:32px 0}.project-origin p:not(.eyebrow),.project-product>header>p,.project-principle p:not(.eyebrow),.project-current p:not(.eyebrow){font-size:18px}.project-pullquote{padding:24px}.project-product{padding:32px 0}.project-journey{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:0;margin:22px 0}.project-journey li{padding:18px 0}.project-screen{padding:12px}.project-screen figcaption{flex-direction:column;gap:8px}.project-current{padding:24px}.project-current .project-button{width:100%;gap:10px;font-size:13px}.project-reading>header{align-items:start;flex-direction:column;gap:12px}.project-reading>div{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px}.project-reading h2{font-size:27px}.project-reading h3{font-size:23px}}
</style>
